@format 1
@id funnel.move-rule
@title Move funnel rule
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Reorder one funnel rule by dragging it to a new position and renumber the list.
@section I. UI
@tabs Funnel
@flow TB
@related funnel.add-rule, funnel.remove-rule

@alias rules = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PFunnelRules

[input] Rule drag begins <input>
- Capture the pressed rule and drag origin @ rules.PFunnelPressHandle(...)
> move

[move] Track requested position <decision>
- Activate dragging after threshold and resolve the target index @ rules.PFunnelMoveHandle(...)
? "The index does not change" > unchanged
? "A different index is reached" > reorder

[reorder] Reorder rule <process>
- Move the rule in the model and visual panel @ rules.PFunnelRowMove(...)
- Reapply rule order labels @ rules.PFunnelOrderApply(...)
> result

[result] Rule moved <output>
= Rule evaluation order matches the visible list.

[unchanged] Order unchanged <output>
= The rule remains at its prior index.
